0..73 Comment "//! Univalence at the corollas of a signature, checked for naturality and"
74..146 Comment "//! shape [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]"
147..226 Comment "//! [Petrakis-2022-univalent_typoids]: a translator must be natural along every"
227..307 Comment "//! automorphism of its corolla, its tables must cover exactly the corollas both"
308..383 Comment "//! models inhabit, and two corollas it relates must have as many elements."
